  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is projected from the ground at an angle of <math><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math> with the horizontal surface. It reaches a maximum height of <math><mn>120</mn><mi>&nbsp;m</mi></math> and returns to the ground. Upon hitting the ground for the first time, it loses half of its kinetic energy. Immediately after the bounce, the velocity of the ball makes an angle of <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math> with the horizontal surface. The maximum height it reaches after the bounce (in meters) is _____________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "30",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/2f366f69-38b3-4c3c-9eed-b47d1f7fdd5c-image.png\"/><br ><math><msub><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mn>45</mn></mrow> <mi>o</mi> </msup> </mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mi> </mi><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br >when half of kinetic energy is lost <math><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>u</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math><br >From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>,<br ><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi> </mi><mn>m</mn></math>",
